From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] office-ext: second install call (docs-office) and the ribbon/icon hook

The three apps call docs_office::install(&mut session) after docs_translit::install, behind the same empty `office-ext` feature
(`cargo xt gen-domain` adds the dependency). The desktop and web apps also hand docs-office's two UI functions to ui-egui once:
office_overlay::set_ext(ribbon_frame, paint_icon). ribbon.rs calls office_overlay::ribbon_frame(&mut session) at the top of
`show` every frame (the simple-ribbon preset is applied after the preferences are loaded, and again when the interface language
changes); icons.rs asks office_overlay::paint_icon first (docs-office draws the Fluent bitmaps for ten command-icon names, false for
every other). With no extension set both calls do nothing.
---
 apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs       |  2 ++
 apps/wordcraft-web/src/web.rs        |  4 ++++
 apps/wordcraft/src/main.rs           |  4 ++++
 crates/ui-egui/src/icons.rs          |  3 +++
 crates/ui-egui/src/office_overlay.rs | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 crates/ui-egui/src/ribbon.rs         |  1 +
 6 files changed, 36 insertions(+)

